# IMPLEMENTATION CHECKLISTS

## Before Starting
- [ ] Check stories.md for current task context
- [ ] Used Sequential Thinking for analysis
- [ ] Created/updated necessary documentation
- [ ] Documented dependencies and versions
- [ ] Identified performance requirements
- [ ] Created test scenarios

## During Implementation
- [ ] Writing tests first
- [ ] Following TypeScript best practices
- [ ] Adding error handling
- [ ] Including performance monitoring
- [ ] Updating stories.md in real-time
- [ ] Marking sub-tasks as completed

## Before Completion
- [ ] All tests passing
- [ ] Coverage requirements met (80% minimum)
- [ ] Performance requirements verified
- [ ] stories.md updated with completion status
- [ ] Technical decisions documented
- [ ] All sub-tasks marked as complete